# Camera and spatial authority (merged)

**Status:** canonical working authority for 3D presentation  
**Physical SoT:** `master/HomeFinder.sh3d`  
**SHA-256:** `0e4d75bcedbf2d9827917cd61c01780d0c1d4ba9b852dbcac65ca63e8353cb34`  
**Date merged:** 2026-08-24  

This file merges former working notes (animation/camera/door, physical UI objects, spatial reconciliation, master camera contract, main-hall camera notes) into one place. Phase-numbered sources were archived or superseded.

## 1. Hard rules

1. Sweet Home 3D cameras are **presentation-only**. They never grant auth, roles, KYC, payments, or data authority.
2. There is **one** operational SH3D: `master/HomeFinder.sh3d`.
3. **HF H-01 … HF H-09** already exist in the model — **bind UI, do not recreate**.
4. Logical POVs (L-*, R-*, ARR-01) are not automatic physical cameras.
5. **R-03** remains HOLD (no physical address field on register).
6. **ARR-01** is retired as a required physical camera; arrival is 2D/cinematic-ui toward **HF H-01**.
7. Production app stays HTML/CSS/JS (+ MapLibre for market). No production WebGL/Three triad.
8. Environment themes affect presentation only.

## 2. Verified camera census (from Home.xml)

| Class | Count | Names |
|-------|------:|-------|
| Active observer | 1 | (unnamed current view) |
| Legacy named | 5 | Living room, Exterior, Corridor, Bedroom #1, Kitchen |
| HomeFinder H-series | 9 | HF H-01 — hero, HF H-02 — discovery, HF H-03 — property-display, HF H-04 — map, HF H-05 — government-desk, HF H-06 — mission, HF H-07 — guide, HF H-08 — safety, HF H-09 — contact |
| **Named total** | **14** | |

Bedroom #2 is a **room**, not a stored camera.

