Login/Register logical POVs stay logical until a future room strategy. Profile and Broker HQ need no new HF camera for v1.

## 4. Physical UI objects

Physical UI object registries and contracts are **presentation mapping** evidence. They must not override Firestore rules, roles, or KYC. Prefer machine contracts under `docs/json/` when present; treat old WalkMyPlan copies as archive.

## 5. Doors, routes, choreography

Door/camera graphs and section choreography guide **presentation transitions** only. Route authorization remains `docs/json` route contracts + Firebase Auth.

## 6. Change control for the SH3D

1. Compare proposed state  
2. Reconcile  
3. Verify (including `verify-hf-cameras` style name check)  
4. Recalculate SHA-256  
5. Update this file + `docs/md/3d-authority.md` + `docs/json/3d-contract.json`  
6. Replace binary deliberately  

## 7. Superseded sources (do not edit as SoT)

Former paths such as `active_development/docs/11-ANIMATION-CAMERA-DOOR-CONTRACT.md`, `12-PHYSICAL-UI-OBJECTS.md`, `13-SPATIAL-RECONCILIATION.md`, `31-MASTER-CAMERA-CONTRACT.md`, `35/36/37` main-hall notes — content folded here or kept only under `docs/md/archive/`.
